WEBVTT

00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:17.700
Listen.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.330
Don't lose it again.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:23.000
Alma Gear is not easy to make.

00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:24.480
I swear.

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:26.300
I swear on my life!

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:33.050
With this... All that ancient hatred...

00:00:33.050 --> 00:00:35.580
I can make right the horrible 
wrongs of the past!

00:02:13.590 --> 00:02:16.490
Don't tell me we're staying 
here for the night.

00:02:16.740 --> 00:02:18.470
Stop your whining.

00:02:18.470 --> 00:02:20.900
It's better than no 
roof or walls at all.

00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:22.910
That might be true,

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:25.900
but we haven't had anything 
decent to eat in days.

00:02:25.900 --> 00:02:30.250
We should get to a town tomorrow, 
so hang on for this last night.

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:32.200
Excuse me, this last night?

00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:34.460
I've heard that before!

00:02:34.460 --> 00:02:36.040
Silence, peasant.

00:02:37.900 --> 00:02:40.590
Looks like something's 
going to come out at us.

00:02:42.930 --> 00:02:45.010
You're so over dramatic.

00:02:45.920 --> 00:02:47.520
It's just a mirror.

00:02:49.310 --> 00:02:51.590
I can't see mirrors!

00:02:51.590 --> 00:02:52.870
Just kidding.

00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:06.870
I'm all sore.

00:03:07.590 --> 00:03:10.490
You can't get a proper night's 
sleep in a place like that.

00:03:10.980 --> 00:03:13.140
I think I slept on this wrong.

00:03:13.140 --> 00:03:15.420
Looks like I need a soft bed

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:18.500
and a pillow with a nice firm body.

00:03:18.860 --> 00:03:20.550
You poor thing.

00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:21.880
I know, right?

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:24.400
You can't calm down unless 
you talk incessantly.

00:03:24.400 --> 00:03:26.010
Is that some sort of illness?

00:03:26.540 --> 00:03:28.310
You're making fun of me!

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:30.600
What, you want pity?

00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:33.120
And there you go, looking 
down on me even more!

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:35.010
Can't you just leave me alone?

00:03:35.010 --> 00:03:37.270
Is it fun to mess with 
people like that?

00:03:37.270 --> 00:03:40.330
You're always treating 
me like worthless scum.

00:03:40.330 --> 00:03:42.370
Seriously, can you cut that out?

00:03:42.370 --> 00:03:45.110
I mean, I'm helping you guys,

00:03:45.110 --> 00:03:47.390
so what the hell is your problem?!

00:04:01.410 --> 00:04:02.050
Did we get them?

00:04:02.450 --> 00:04:04.230
Sadly, it was a miss.

00:04:04.870 --> 00:04:05.800
But

00:04:06.460 --> 00:04:08.060
a nice introduction nonetheless.

00:04:08.060 --> 00:04:08.970
Charge!

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:18.820
What just happened?

00:04:19.300 --> 00:04:20.820
Kon, it's an ambush!

00:04:21.840 --> 00:04:22.650
Princess!

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:28.160
How the hell do they know where we are?

00:04:31.880 --> 00:04:32.990
I don't know.

00:04:32.990 --> 00:04:35.250
The only thing we need 
to worry about now is

00:04:35.890 --> 00:04:37.710
what are we going to do?

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:38.820
We run away.

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:40.300
It's our only choice.

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:44.680
It doesn't look like they'll 
just let us run away.

00:04:44.960 --> 00:04:47.430
Confuse the enemy, find an 
opening, and slip through.

00:04:47.880 --> 00:04:49.190
That's the right thing to do.

00:04:49.610 --> 00:04:50.430
Roger!

00:04:50.860 --> 00:04:52.590
Keep the cliff at your back, Marian!

00:04:52.590 --> 00:04:53.800
Then you don't have to worry about

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:54.980
the enemy sneaking up on you.

00:04:54.980 --> 00:04:55.910
Yes.

00:04:55.910 --> 00:04:57.210
Let's go, Princess.

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:15.580
Stay back.

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:16.330
Stay back!

00:05:20.410 --> 00:05:22.270
First we have to silence DT.

00:05:22.730 --> 00:05:25.970
I'll close in on him and bring 
him down without mercy!

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:30.060
Can you stop making me your 
archnemesis all the time?

00:05:30.060 --> 00:05:31.260
Please?

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:33.560
He's got a point.

00:05:33.790 --> 00:05:36.850
If you only look at Kon, you won't 
get away with just a scratch.

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:43.860
That goes both ways.

00:05:48.350 --> 00:05:50.570
Damn, I missed.

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:53.790
Something's different.

00:05:54.360 --> 00:05:57.270
They're coordinated and 
following their leader.

00:05:57.900 --> 00:05:58.520
And...

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:01.090
And their weapons!

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:03.050
They're in a totally different class!

00:06:03.050 --> 00:06:04.920
This is... This is almost like...

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:06.920
Alma Gear?

00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:09.190
That's right!

00:06:09.190 --> 00:06:12.630
These are the new weapons 
Erec-sama gave us.

00:06:13.550 --> 00:06:16.500
They're masterpieces that 
allow even normal people

00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:18.890
like us to exhibit 
amazing battle prowess.

00:06:19.380 --> 00:06:22.240
They are called DDOS.

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:29.030
I'm going to end our rivalry

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:30.910
with one hit from Calibre!

00:06:30.910 --> 00:06:33.030
What the hell is a Calibre?

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:36.680
I told you to stay back!

00:06:42.240 --> 00:06:44.110
So, uh, um...

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:48.800
Princess!

00:06:51.800 --> 00:06:53.650
Princess!

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:57.060
Seriously?

00:07:03.710 --> 00:07:04.840
Leon!

00:07:04.840 --> 00:07:07.070
Looks like he fell in.

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:07.850
Don't tell me...

00:07:08.410 --> 00:07:09.290
We're going down there.

00:07:10.290 --> 00:07:12.550
He's not one to die from 
something like this.

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:15.660
Neither Leon nor the others.

00:07:25.130 --> 00:07:26.090
I'm alive.

00:07:26.650 --> 00:07:30.560
Just the fact that I'm 
alive is a huge win.

00:07:34.180 --> 00:07:35.830
Is the Princess all right?

00:07:35.830 --> 00:07:36.750
Yes.

00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:38.680
Thank god Marian was holding her.

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:39.980
She has no serious injuries.

00:07:40.740 --> 00:07:42.560
She'll open her eyes soon.

00:07:43.140 --> 00:07:44.810
They're already open.

00:07:45.140 --> 00:07:46.150
Princess!

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:50.190
Where is the one who saved my life?

00:07:50.590 --> 00:07:52.150
Well...

00:07:52.550 --> 00:07:54.830
I can't see the person 
who saved your life,

00:07:55.660 --> 00:07:57.480
but I do see him.

00:08:06.060 --> 00:08:07.390
Status?

00:08:07.390 --> 00:08:09.320
We haven't seen Leon yet.

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:10.850
But...

00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:15.020
We did find someone else.

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:20.810
Shall we begin?

00:08:22.540 --> 00:08:24.810
What, exactly?

00:08:25.410 --> 00:08:26.560
Isn't it obvious?

00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:30.080
Does that mean we're going to do it?

00:08:30.080 --> 00:08:32.320
A little somethin' somethin'?

00:08:32.830 --> 00:08:34.070
A little what, exactly?

00:08:34.300 --> 00:08:37.760
A lady doesn't talk about such things.

00:08:38.850 --> 00:08:42.660
Oh I see, it's already begun!

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:44.330
So first you're verbally abusing me!

00:08:45.640 --> 00:08:47.380
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:08:47.830 --> 00:08:51.340
We only want to poke and prod a little.

00:08:51.690 --> 00:08:53.220
Poke and prod?

00:08:53.500 --> 00:08:54.560
That's right.

00:08:54.560 --> 00:08:56.950
Just answer our questions in all 
honesty and you should b—

00:08:57.720 --> 00:08:59.310
Wh-What?

00:08:59.310 --> 00:09:00.700
First you want to poke me

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:02.360
and then you want to prod me?

00:09:02.360 --> 00:09:04.520
What exactly do you have in mind?

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:06.610
Oh, you pervert!

00:09:05.480 --> 00:09:06.610
She's really stupid.

00:09:06.610 --> 00:09:07.700
Definitely stupid.

00:09:08.170 --> 00:09:10.190
Not just stupid, 
a masochist, as well.

00:09:11.340 --> 00:09:13.930
<i>I don't have a choice.</i>

00:09:13.930 --> 00:09:15.800
<i>I just have to play the 
fool and buy some time.</i>

00:09:19.310 --> 00:09:19.950
Hey.

00:09:21.320 --> 00:09:23.700
Can't you tie me up better than this?

00:09:24.120 --> 00:09:25.790
Stop whining.

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:28.610
This is the traditional 
Japanese bamboo wrap.

00:09:28.610 --> 00:09:30.710
You should be thankful for this wrap!

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:32.460
And?

00:09:33.030 --> 00:09:35.390
Now what do we do with him?

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:38.380
You should know that your 
efforts will be futile.

00:09:38.380 --> 00:09:40.470
I have no intention of 
telling you anything.

00:09:40.910 --> 00:09:42.110
Not to mention,

00:09:42.110 --> 00:09:44.410
I have specifically trained 
myself to be able

00:09:44.410 --> 00:09:45.420
to endure any degree of pa—

00:09:45.420 --> 00:09:46.520
Is that so?

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:49.340
If you say so,

00:09:50.240 --> 00:09:51.610
I guess I don't need to hold back.

00:09:57.020 --> 00:09:58.470
Princess, stop.

00:09:58.470 --> 00:09:59.830
Why are you stopping me?

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:01.410
Look at him.

00:10:02.460 --> 00:10:03.910
He loves it.

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:06.450
That's ridiculous!

00:10:06.450 --> 00:10:08.640
I am absolutely not a masochist!

00:10:08.640 --> 00:10:11.340
So come at me! Let me have it!

00:10:11.340 --> 00:10:13.160
Come on! Come on!

00:10:14.010 --> 00:10:15.210
I think this is the 
first time I've felt

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:17.970
such strong regret for 
stepping on someone.

00:10:19.730 --> 00:10:23.060
First, would you tell me your name?

00:10:23.680 --> 00:10:26.390
You sound like someone 
trying to pick me up,

00:10:27.110 --> 00:10:30.190
but that's not what you 
want to know, right?

00:10:30.510 --> 00:10:31.870
I just don't like prying secrets

00:10:31.870 --> 00:10:35.440
from a lady without 
even knowing her name.

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:37.010
My name is Mariandel,

00:10:37.010 --> 00:10:38.520
but you can call me Marian.

00:10:38.520 --> 00:10:39.790
Mariandel.

00:10:40.390 --> 00:10:41.320
That's a good name.

00:10:41.590 --> 00:10:44.950
Is that a roundabout 
way of asking me out?

00:10:46.470 --> 00:10:50.560
Erec-sama, is that really okay? 
I'll tell Emilia-sama.

00:10:50.560 --> 00:10:51.620
What are you talking about?

00:10:51.620 --> 00:10:52.710
I'm just trying to...

00:10:53.030 --> 00:10:56.420
Oh, I don't mind.

00:10:57.050 --> 00:11:00.590
In these affairs, the higher the hurdle,

00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:03.050
the hotter the heart burns!

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:06.470
Or I could be your second wife.

00:11:06.470 --> 00:11:07.490
A lust monster.

00:11:07.960 --> 00:11:09.220
Definitely a lust monster.

00:11:09.220 --> 00:11:10.820
Indeed, a lust monster,

00:11:10.820 --> 00:11:13.210
and an idiot and a masochist to boot.

00:11:13.210 --> 00:11:15.990
So this is who we were fighting?

00:11:15.990 --> 00:11:18.490
Though I think I could kind 
of get along with her.

00:11:19.030 --> 00:11:21.140
Who are you, anyway?

00:11:21.140 --> 00:11:23.210
Who do you work for?

00:11:23.210 --> 00:11:25.920
I want to know how many legions, 
about those new weapons...

00:11:25.920 --> 00:11:28.200
I want to know everything about you.

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:29.340
I already told you.

00:11:29.740 --> 00:11:32.420
You won't get anything out of me.

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:34.110
What did you say?!

00:11:35.510 --> 00:11:36.680
Is that so?

00:11:36.680 --> 00:11:38.280
Then I guess that's that.

00:11:38.280 --> 00:11:39.590
We won't ask you again.

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:43.220
So I've been meaning to ask, gramps.

00:11:43.220 --> 00:11:44.390
You're the strongest 
in your group, right?

00:11:44.900 --> 00:11:46.110
What are you talking about?

00:11:46.110 --> 00:11:48.720
Obviously Erec-sama is the strongest.

00:11:48.720 --> 00:11:50.380
Then me.

00:11:50.380 --> 00:11:52.590
I thought so!

00:11:52.590 --> 00:11:53.980
And who's the next strongest?

00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:56.620
I guess if I had to pick 
the next strongest,

00:11:56.620 --> 00:11:58.620
it would be Gustave, but he 
is quite a ways below me.

00:11:58.620 --> 00:12:00.540
Though his weakness for 
women is problematic.

00:12:00.540 --> 00:12:03.110
Does that mean the rest of 
them are all weaklings?

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:04.970
They're useful enough,

00:12:04.970 --> 00:12:07.940
but KT is a raging drunk and 
Variation is still a kid.

00:12:07.940 --> 00:12:09.320
I see.

00:12:09.320 --> 00:12:11.100
So you're saying that that thing that

00:12:11.100 --> 00:12:14.130
rained down from the sky 
was shot by KT from afar?

00:12:14.130 --> 00:12:15.460
I can't answer that.

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:18.120
The Mangonel is classified after all.

00:12:18.120 --> 00:12:21.360
I see, can't do anything about that.

00:12:21.360 --> 00:12:23.410
Yes, even if my mouth were pried open, 
I couldn't answer that.

00:12:25.540 --> 00:12:27.860
<i>He's an idiot. We have 
an idiot in our midst.</i>

00:12:27.860 --> 00:12:30.180
<i>He's not just a masochist, 
he's a huge idiot.</i>

00:12:31.370 --> 00:12:34.560
So now what do we do?

00:12:35.210 --> 00:12:38.060
Carrying him with us 
would be a huge pain.

00:12:38.060 --> 00:12:40.220
I'm worried about Marian, too.

00:12:40.220 --> 00:12:43.300
Seeing that she hasn't shown 
up after all this time,

00:12:43.300 --> 00:12:46.450
the probability that she 
was taken hostage is high.

00:12:46.790 --> 00:12:50.080
Let's kill him and go rescue Marian.

00:12:50.420 --> 00:12:52.430
I guess that's the regular 
course of action.

00:12:52.430 --> 00:12:54.250
Then let's do it.

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:55.590
Hold on.

00:12:55.590 --> 00:12:56.600
What?

00:12:56.600 --> 00:12:58.320
He said before

00:12:58.320 --> 00:13:01.360
that they would chase 
us until we died.

00:13:01.360 --> 00:13:02.720
That's the kind of people they are.

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:06.150
So let's put an end to this.

00:13:07.190 --> 00:13:09.970
That's right!

00:13:10.210 --> 00:13:13.850
You should have seen his face 
right then! It was so funny!

00:13:14.220 --> 00:13:16.580
Like, he was all talk,

00:13:16.580 --> 00:13:19.840
but I bet he had no real experience!

00:13:19.840 --> 00:13:20.860
Sir,

00:13:21.990 --> 00:13:24.290
the recon troop has found Leon-sama

00:13:24.290 --> 00:13:26.240
and they are now headed this way.

00:13:26.580 --> 00:13:27.550
Is he all right?

00:13:27.550 --> 00:13:32.760
Yes, but when they found 
him, he was tied to a tree.

00:13:33.640 --> 00:13:36.660
You mean he had been their prisoner?

00:13:37.120 --> 00:13:39.540
And yet they released 
him without harm.

00:13:39.540 --> 00:13:40.880
What does that mean?

00:13:41.320 --> 00:13:44.130
This was left on Leon-sama's back.

00:13:47.330 --> 00:13:48.510
Prepare to head out.

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:51.510
Erec-sama, what did they write?

00:13:52.360 --> 00:13:53.960
It's from DT.

00:13:53.960 --> 00:13:56.300
Apparently, he's finally 
ready to settle this.

00:14:01.370 --> 00:14:03.530
The designated time is in five hours.

00:14:03.930 --> 00:14:06.570
The place will be the castle 
ruins on the top of the cliff.

00:14:16.690 --> 00:14:18.490
Go. You're free.

00:14:18.970 --> 00:14:19.710
Why?

00:14:19.710 --> 00:14:22.580
Returning a favor is 
part of our beliefs.

00:14:22.580 --> 00:14:25.600
However, the next time we 
meet, we won't hold back.

00:14:25.600 --> 00:14:26.720
Remember that.

00:14:28.500 --> 00:14:29.600
It's strange.

00:14:29.600 --> 00:14:32.220
You have the same smell as me.

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:34.220
Smell?

00:14:37.660 --> 00:14:39.530
Don't mind me, just a feeling.

00:14:40.340 --> 00:14:42.190
Are you sure about this?

00:14:42.190 --> 00:14:43.990
I'm completely sure.

00:14:46.220 --> 00:14:47.160
It's Marian!

00:14:47.160 --> 00:14:48.610
Hey!

00:14:49.370 --> 00:14:50.620
Didn't I tell you?

00:14:50.620 --> 00:14:53.620
You knights and warriors and 
whatever are simple people.

00:14:54.750 --> 00:14:58.750
I learned that from 
anime and period drama.

00:15:02.770 --> 00:15:04.470
I'm glad you made it back!

00:15:04.470 --> 00:15:06.310
We're glad you're safe.

00:15:06.310 --> 00:15:07.740
Thanks, guys.

00:15:08.310 --> 00:15:09.290
Hey, sis,

00:15:09.290 --> 00:15:11.470
I know this is sudden, but 
can you give us a hand?

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:15.490
We're preparing a welcoming party.

00:15:28.670 --> 00:15:30.490
Attack!

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:33.530
We don't know what sort of cowardly 
tricks DT has in store for us,

00:15:33.520 --> 00:15:35.080
so stay focused!

00:15:38.690 --> 00:15:39.390
What is this?

00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:41.110
This is...

00:15:41.110 --> 00:15:42.080
Suspicious.

00:15:42.080 --> 00:15:44.110
Is it telling us to go that way?

00:15:44.700 --> 00:15:46.090
He's provoking us!

00:15:46.570 --> 00:15:47.470
That's fine.

00:15:47.470 --> 00:15:49.590
I'll play, DT!

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:52.520
What is this?

00:15:53.030 --> 00:15:54.020
A trap?

00:15:54.020 --> 00:15:56.100
But it's too obvious.

00:15:58.970 --> 00:16:01.100
Th-That's...

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:03.230
Hey, Leon!

00:16:03.980 --> 00:16:05.310
I understand.

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:07.320
It's a very good thing.

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:09.440
Look at this, Erec-sama.

00:16:09.700 --> 00:16:13.220
With this machine, you can 
condition your muscles like so.

00:16:18.420 --> 00:16:19.240
It was a trap.

00:16:19.730 --> 00:16:21.120
A trap.

00:16:21.530 --> 00:16:23.960
A trap, no matter how you look at it.

00:16:29.410 --> 00:16:30.340
This is...

00:16:30.720 --> 00:16:31.550
...a trap.

00:16:31.900 --> 00:16:33.010
It's definitely a trap.

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:35.890
Let's see.

00:16:36.400 --> 00:16:37.760
Hey, Gustave...

00:16:37.960 --> 00:16:39.630
Watch this!

00:16:39.630 --> 00:16:43.770
I'll show you what I think 
of their silly little traps.

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:46.480
Just don't get caught in it.

00:16:46.780 --> 00:16:48.150
Shut up and watch.

00:16:56.120 --> 00:16:57.490
See, that's all it—

00:17:05.510 --> 00:17:06.540
This is...

00:17:06.780 --> 00:17:07.750
Not again...

00:17:08.050 --> 00:17:09.000
It's that again.

00:17:09.720 --> 00:17:12.260
I feel like it's my turn now.

00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:17.500
What are you doing?!

00:17:20.570 --> 00:17:21.710
Reporting in!

00:17:21.710 --> 00:17:25.620
Our men are getting taken out 
by traps all over the castle.

00:17:25.620 --> 00:17:27.820
Tell them all to stop 
touching everything!

00:17:29.430 --> 00:17:31.910
Damn, he's really screwing with us!

00:17:31.910 --> 00:17:36.410
Why is he setting up all 
these stupid traps?

00:17:36.920 --> 00:17:39.310
I don't know his motivations, 
but I have a feeling

00:17:39.310 --> 00:17:41.810
we might already be 
right where he wants us.

00:17:41.810 --> 00:17:43.480
Don't get taken in by his words.

00:17:43.870 --> 00:17:45.040
Stay focused!

00:17:45.040 --> 00:17:46.180
Yes, sir!

00:17:49.370 --> 00:17:52.880
Heroes, you've done 
well to come this far.

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:54.590
I'll congratulate you for that.

00:17:54.590 --> 00:17:56.890
That's DT's voice!

00:17:56.890 --> 00:17:57.680
Where are you?!

00:17:58.070 --> 00:18:01.220
I am the king of kings.

00:18:01.740 --> 00:18:03.750
His voice is reverberating.

00:18:03.750 --> 00:18:05.940
We have no way of knowing where he is.

00:18:05.940 --> 00:18:12.090
I have been waiting for someone 
young like you to appear.

00:18:12.090 --> 00:18:14.610
You're younger than we are.

00:18:14.610 --> 00:18:19.210
Which is why I ask you, Amuro, 
to join forces with me.

00:18:19.210 --> 00:18:23.580
If you join me, you shall 
have half the world.

00:18:24.980 --> 00:18:28.000
The homeless guy is telling 
me he'll give me the world.

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:30.120
Don't listen to his lies!

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:31.930
You guys are a horrible crowd.

00:18:31.930 --> 00:18:35.420
All right, fine, you're going to blast me

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:37.410
with the memories of 
Elias and other comrades?

00:18:37.410 --> 00:18:38.550
Who's Elias?

00:18:39.170 --> 00:18:41.030
Oh jeez, you really don't get it.

00:18:41.030 --> 00:18:43.480
Listen, it's a given that 
there's a speech right

00:18:43.480 --> 00:18:44.930
before the fight with the last boss.

00:18:45.450 --> 00:18:48.440
Since you don't even know 
the basics, eat this.

00:18:54.620 --> 00:18:56.420
Is this oil?!

00:18:56.420 --> 00:18:58.200
Are you planning to burn us alive?!

00:18:58.200 --> 00:19:00.570
No, I bet it's some sort of acid!

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:07.580
It doesn't burn.

00:19:08.050 --> 00:19:09.770
It's not oil or acid.

00:19:10.150 --> 00:19:12.580
This is lube!

00:19:14.240 --> 00:19:16.220
I bet it feels gross to be so slimy!

00:19:16.220 --> 00:19:18.830
This stuff is pretty 
hard to wash out, too!

00:19:22.090 --> 00:19:25.620
You forgot that there are 
people who like lube!

00:19:26.960 --> 00:19:29.220
Enough! DT!

00:19:29.220 --> 00:19:31.820
You said you wanted to settle this!

00:19:31.820 --> 00:19:36.280
Show yourself and fight us properly!

00:19:36.280 --> 00:19:37.790
I'm sorry, Erec...

00:19:38.990 --> 00:19:42.070
It's my thing to not enter 
fights I can't win.

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:51.250
What now?!

00:19:51.700 --> 00:19:55.900
I've had enough of this! 
Show yourself, DT!

00:19:55.900 --> 00:19:57.320
All right.

00:20:04.660 --> 00:20:07.890
So you finally show yourself, DT!

00:20:07.890 --> 00:20:10.890
Oh, if you dare to get any closer,

00:20:10.890 --> 00:20:12.650
I don't know what might happen to you.

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:13.800
What?

00:20:13.800 --> 00:20:15.180
What do you mean?

00:20:15.180 --> 00:20:18.280
Don't pay attention to what he says!

00:20:18.700 --> 00:20:23.280
Oh, you don't have to, 
but are you really sure?

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:24.960
Look where you're standing.

00:20:26.020 --> 00:20:27.990
If you move any further,

00:20:27.990 --> 00:20:30.700
the countless booby traps

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:32.370
I picked up from Rambo and Kubrick

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:34.040
will make mincemeat out of you all.

00:20:35.180 --> 00:20:36.290
He's bluffing.

00:20:36.830 --> 00:20:38.990
If you think so, just try it.

00:20:38.990 --> 00:20:41.890
If you move just one step, boom!

00:20:41.890 --> 00:20:44.180
That might be the result.

00:20:58.630 --> 00:20:59.690
Erec-sama?

00:21:02.970 --> 00:21:04.850
You've used your dirty 
tricks successfully

00:21:04.850 --> 00:21:06.320
to cheat me many times,

00:21:06.810 --> 00:21:08.830
but that ends now!

00:21:10.740 --> 00:21:12.580
It was foolish to presume 
that I couldn't

00:21:12.590 --> 00:21:14.210
defeat you if I couldn't approach you.

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:18.590
That cowardly tactic 
was your downfall, DT!

00:21:19.530 --> 00:21:21.710
Huh, what do you mean?

00:21:21.900 --> 00:21:26.590
Die while you behold the 
power of the Calibre!

00:21:31.850 --> 00:21:34.060
Stop!

00:21:50.780 --> 00:21:51.830
You did it.

00:21:51.850 --> 00:21:53.220
Is it over?

00:21:53.220 --> 00:21:55.590
DT is finally gone.

00:21:55.590 --> 00:21:57.420
A masterful strike, Erec-sama.

00:21:58.630 --> 00:21:59.840
<i>It's over.</i>

00:22:00.790 --> 00:22:04.380
<i>The long days of humiliation 
are finally over.</i>

00:22:05.510 --> 00:22:06.430
Move out!

00:22:07.720 --> 00:22:09.050
Mission complete!

00:24:10.010 --> 00:24:24.900
<b>Next Time</b>

00:24:11.380 --> 00:24:13.400
DT and Ecarlate are dead.

00:24:13.400 --> 00:24:15.970
But since I had my doubts,

00:24:15.970 --> 00:24:18.320
I decided to observe 
the two who survived.

00:24:18.320 --> 00:24:20.770
Did those two really die?

00:24:20.770 --> 00:24:24.270
And then, something 
surprising happened.

00:24:24.920 --> 00:24:28.900
Are Kon and the Princess dead?

00:24:24.920 --> 00:24:28.900
Ixion Saga DT grows intense!

00:24:28.900 --> 00:24:34.610
With the main character dead,

00:24:28.900 --> 00:24:34.610
will it be discontinued?!
